									{
										[
											"12–18 hours avoided wrong Back button implementation and review cycle",
											"debug_defect classified root cause in one session; forbade timeout padding",
											"Round 2 journey_attest caught stale verdicts before ship",
											"Vertical through_domain_and_data plus horizontal seams signed off",
										].map((line) => (
											<li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 py-3">
												<span class="font-mono-cta text-sm text-brand-mcp">✓</span>
												<span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">{line}</span>
											</li>
										))
									}
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6">
							<div class="border-l-2 border-brand-warn-border pl-6">
								<p class="font-mono-cta text-[13px] normal-case tracking-[0.01em] text-brand-warn">We don't say</p>
								<ul class="mt-5 divide-y divide-white/[0.06] border-t border-border">
									{
										[
											"AADM saved 90% of development",
											"AADM fixed production",
											"Zero bugs after AADM",
											"Certified compliant",
										].map((line) => (
											<li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 py-3">
												<span class="font-mono-cta text-sm text-brand-warn">✗</span>
												<span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{line}</span>
											</li>
										))
									}
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<p class="mt-14 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
						<span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Honest boundary ·</span> AADM MCP frames problems, names seams, and enforces
						proof obligations. <span class="font-light italic text-muted-foreground">Your repository's tests and evidence</span> still
						decide pass/fail. That's the line, and we hold it.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- =============================================================
		     §05 — Share your story + CTA
		     ============================================================= -->
		<section class="relative bg-surface-deep">
			<div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(110,231,183,0.07),transparent_60%)]"></div>
			<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 px-4 py-28 sm:py-32 sm:px-8 sm:py-32">
				<aside class="col-span-12 mb-10 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border pb-4 sm:col-span-2 sm:mb-0 sm:flex-col sm:items-start sm:justify-start sm:gap-3 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:border-border sm:pb-0 sm:pr-4">
					<span class="font-mono-cta text-[13px] normal-case tracking-[0.01em] text-brand-mcp">§ 05</span>
					<span class="font-mono-cta text-[13px] normal-case tracking-[0.01em] text-muted-foreground">Yours</span>
				</aside>

				<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-10">
					<h2 class="font-display max-w-[16ch] text-balance text-[clamp(2rem,5.5vw,4.4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground">
						The best case study <span class="font-light italic text-muted-foreground">is yours.</span>
					</h2>
					<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
						Try the patterns on something real this week. Catch a classification bug, attest a release without theater, onboard
						a senior engineer in a week. When it works, tell us — we'll feature consenting teams here.
					</p>

					<div class="mt-14 flex flex-col flex-wrap items-start gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4">
						<a
							href={urlMcpMarketing}
							class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-foreground px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-background outline-none transition duration-200 hover:bg-brand-mcp hover:text-brand-mcp-fg"
						>
							<span>See how the MCP works</span>
							<svg width="16" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">
								<path d="M1 5h13M10 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="square" />
							</svg>
						</a>
						<a
							href={urlStandard}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border bg-transparent px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground outline-none transition duration-200 hover:border-foreground/25 hover:bg-accent"
						>
							Read the standard
						</a>
						<a
							href="/why-aadm"
							class="group font-mono-cta inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm normal-case tracking-[0.01em] text-muted-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-[6px] transition hover:text-brand-mcp hover:decoration-brand-mcp"
						>
							<span>Why AADM, vs raw loops</span>
							<span aria-hidden="true" class="transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
						</a>
					</div>

					<!-- Colophon -->
					<div class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 border-t border-border pt-8 font-mono-cta text-[13px] normal-case tracking-[0.01em] text-muted-foreground">
						<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6">
							<span class="text-muted-foreground">Catalog</span> · {vignettes.length} vignettes
						</div>
						<div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6">
							<span class="text-muted-foreground">Hours band</span> · <span class="text-brand-mcp">~{totalLow.toLocaleString()}–{totalHigh.toLocaleString()} engineer-hours redirected</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
